            "speakerId": 21633,
            "speakerName": "Qispi",
            "text": "Mmm... Patience, patience is the key. When things have quietened down, I'll feed these to the Treasure Stone... Hehe, thanks for bringing these rocks...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910402"
            ]
          },
          "750910402": {
            "id": "750910402",
            "speakerId": 21633,
            "speakerName": "Qispi",
            "text": "C'mon Treasure Stone, time to make some even better rocks, hehe... One, two..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7509105",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750910501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750910501": {
            "id": "750910501",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Would you look at that, it's done it again, and they're even better than before... Still feels pretty magical, despite the fact that we've seen it twice now...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910502"
            ]
          },
          "750910502": {
            "id": "750910502",
            "speakerId": 21633,
            "speakerName": "Qispi",
            "text": "Heh, hehe, wary outlanders...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910503"
            ]
          },
          "750910503": {
            "id": "750910503",
            "speakerId": 21633,
            "speakerName": "Qispi",
            "text": "Now that you have seen it for yourselves, you can no longer deny the greatness of the Treasure Stone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910504"
            ]
          },
          "750910504": {
            "id": "750910504",
            "speakerId": 21633,
            "speakerName": "Qispi",
            "text": "Aaah, and thanks to the rocks you have brought, the Treasure Stone's power has grown even stronger...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910505"
            ]
          },
          "750910505": {
            "id": "750910505",
            "speakerId": 21633,
            "speakerName": "Qispi",
            "text": "Who knows how powerful it might become...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910506"
            ]
          },
          "750910506": {
            "id": "750910506",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Now that you mention it, even Paimon's starting to feel curious...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910507"
            ]
          },
          "750910507": {
            "id": "750910507",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "All you have to do is feed it rocks and it creates even better ones for you... But how does that even work? Why don't we crack it open and take a look inside?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910508"
            ]
          },
          "750910508": {
            "id": "750910508",
            "speakerId": 21633,
            "speakerName": "Qispi",
            "text": "H—How could you even suggest such a thing? No, I shall not allow it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910509"
            ]
          },
          "750910509": {
            "id": "750910509",
            "speakerId": 21633,
            "speakerName": "Qispi",
            "text": "If you're seriously planning on cracking it open... You'll have to step over my cold, dead body first...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910510"
            ]
          },
          "750910510": {
            "id": "750910510",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uhh, that was just a throwaway comment...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910511"
            ]
          },
          "750910511": {
            "id": "750910511",
            "speakerId": 21633,
            "speakerName": "Qispi",
            "text": "Hmph, well considering that you brought it all those rocks before, I'll let your impudence slide... But just this once...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910512"
            ]
          },
          "750910512": {
            "id": "750910512",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "O—Okay...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910513"
            ]
          },
          "750910513": {
            "id": "750910513",
            "speakerId": 21633,
            "speakerName": "Qispi",
            "text": "I can feel it, hehe! If I can just feed the Treasure Stone some even higher quality rocks, I'm certain it'll produce something incredible...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910514"
            ]
          },
          "750910514": {
            "id": "750910514",
            "speakerId": 21633,
            "speakerName": "Qispi",
            "text": "Traveler from afar, a foreign merchant once told me of a special type of stone from the desert that holds extraordinary power in store...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910515"
            ]
          },
          "750910515": {
            "id": "750910515",
            "speakerId": 21633,
            "speakerName": "Qispi",
            "text": "Its name... Yes, its name is Trishiraite. If you could but bring me it so I could feed it to the Treasure Stone...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910516"
            ]
          },
          "750910516": {
            "id": "750910516",
            "speakerId": 21633,
            "speakerName": "Qispi",
            "text": "I'm certain, beyond a doubt...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910517"
            ]
          },
          "750910517": {
            "id": "750910517",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Hmm... What do you think, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910518"
            ]
          },
          "750910518": {
            "id": "750910518",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Let's give it a try!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910519"
            ]
          },
          "750910519": {
            "id": "750910519",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon's feeling pretty curious to see what will happen too, that's for sure...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750910520"
            ]
          },
          "750910520": {
            "id": "750910520",
            "speakerId": 21633,
            "speakerName": "Qispi",
            "text": "If you really can get your hands on Trishiraite... A single chunk should suffice..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
